    "body": "I think this is a spec bug. \"HTML element\" is [defined](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#html-elements) to mean any element in the [HTML namespace](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace) (\"`http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml`\"), which includes custom elements.",
