    "created_at": "2018-07-24T21:16:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-24T21:16:13Z",
    "body": "HTML elements have a namespace - `http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml`. This namespace doesn't do anything, and we try our best to make sure it never matters and people don't have to think about it, because XML Namespaces were a very badly-designed feature.",
